{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05833","headline":"赠从弟司库员外絿 · 王维","name":"赠从弟司库员外絿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年识事浅，强学干名利。\n徒闻跃马年，苦无出人智。\n即事岂徒言，累官非不试。\n既寡遂性欢，恐招负时累。\n清冬见远山，积雪凝苍翠。\n浩然出东林，发我遗世意。\n惠连素清赏，夙语尘外事。\n欲缓携手期，流年一何驶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}